sequenceDiagram
autonumber

actor FE as Frontend / Postman
participant GW as Gateway :8099
participant SET as Setting Service :8092
participant AIC as Auth Internal Client
participant SDB as Setting DB
participant ADB as Auth DB

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,ADB: User Reference Data
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/users/reference-data
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>SDB: Load companies + roles + statuses
SET->>SDB: Load usernamePolicy + passwordPolicy
SET->>AIC: Resolve USER page privileges
AIC->>ADB: Get role-page-task access
ADB-->>AIC: privileges
AIC-->>SET: privileges
SET-->>GW: reference-data
GW-->>FE: Response
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,SDB: Create User
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/users
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>SDB: Validate username/password policy
SET->>SDB: Validate unique username/email
SET->>SDB: Insert user
SET->>SDB: Insert default user_company mapping
SET-->>GW: created profile
GW-->>FE: Response
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,SDB: View / Update / Status
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/users/view {id}
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>SDB: Find user by id
SET-->>GW: profileDetails (newUsername)
GW-->>FE: Response

FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/users/update {id,...}
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>SDB: Update user + mapping sync
SET-->>GW: updated profile
GW-->>FE: Response

FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/users/status {id,status}
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>SDB: Update status/loginStatus
SET-->>GW: updated profile
GW-->>FE: Response
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,SDB: Filter List
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/users/filter-list
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>SDB: Filter + sort + paginate
SET-->>GW: content[] + totalRecords\n(content uses newUsername)
GW-->>FE: Response
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,SDB: Profile Image
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/users/profile-image/update
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>SDB: Save base64 doc + metadata
SET-->>GW: updated profile
GW-->>FE: Response
end
